web    running   freebsd   freebsd-15   g1    10.20.0.10                                 -         -           -      3h

$ jailops list -c name,state
┌──────┬─────────┐
│ NAME │ STATE   │
├──────┼─────────┤
│ db   │ stopped │
│ web  │ running │
└──────┴─────────┘

$ jailops image list --sort name -o compact
NAME         OS        RELEASE        ARCH    GENERATIONS
freebsd-15   freebsd   15.0-RELEASE   amd64   1

$ jailops -q stop web

$ jailops -q jail snapshot create db s1

$ jailops -q stop ghost
